	(text "With the R82 at 10K and C26 at 1µF, the input HPF is ~17Hz. \nIf VCO B's DPDT LFO toggle gets flipped into 1µF timing-cap mode, \nthe sine output will drop off below ~20Hz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 71.882 63.754 0)
